      "message": "LGTM.\n\nIt might be possible to simplify this because if we\u0027re forcing a reconnect, there\u0027s no reason to wait for the capabilities callback. The reconnect happens because wifi does not go from unmetereed to metered without a reconnect because that could cause unwanted data use. So, when the network reconnects, the meteredness should be correct already.\n\nWhen not forcing a reconnect (e.g., when going from metered to unmetered) I guess we do want to wait for the callback though. So perhaps we can\u0027t use this fact to simplify the code. Anyway, not for this CL.",
